# Signatures for rubocop 1.92 (it ships none): the node callbacks every cop defines and only the Commissioner calls,
# by `cop.public_send(callback, node)` with the callback in a variable, so no call types their parameter and every
# `node.children`, `node.type` and `node.loc` in a cop was a dynamic call. Cop::Base defines none of them: these
# declare what its subclasses take (decision 470). Each is a RuboCop::AST::Node: the Commissioner walks the AST and
# passes its nodes, whatever their class. Generated from Parser::Meta::NODE_TYPES and rubocop-ast NODE_MAP.
module RuboCop
